<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</title>
<headline>Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture Secretariat December subproduct shipment figures, followed by January to December totals, in tonnes, (year-earlier in brackets):</p>
<p> Soymeal plts    526,999  (680,248)  8,329,359  (6,895,704)</p>
<p> Sunseed plts    122,259   (64,834)  1,937,203  (1,864,049)</p>
<p> Cotton plts	 1,530    (8,513)    230,243    (260,992)</p>
<p> Linseed expls	 nil	(nil)    110,604    (100,412)</p>
<p> Groundnut plts    6,200    (7,397)     57,351     (73,246)</p>
<p> Other plt/expl   22,416   (14,547)    247,327    (236,406)</p>
<p> Soybean oil     104,225  (152,792)  1,657,795  (1,472,489)</p>
<p>    Sunoil	  92,352   (115,163) 1,376,473   (1,329,234)</p>
<p>Principal destinations in December were as follows (tonnes):</p>
<p>SOYPELLETS: Holland 88,929; Italy 101,895; Iran 46,250; Denmark 49,638.</p>
<p>SUNPELLETS: Holland 44,142; Britain 39,884; Denmark 27,108</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0666))</p>
